column3:
There are beds enough
for all of you. Come;
I'll show you the room.{page_break}Try to rest while you
can. This palace is not
a safe place tonight.{end_wait}

I'm glad {actor_name:7}
can see her family
again.{page_break}I hope she can
forget these rooms
for a little while.{end_wait}

Babi is a careful man{em_dash}
he does not choose
favorites lightly.{page_break}What does he see in
those warriors? What
does he want from them?{end_wait}
